  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Joint International Taskforce on Shared Intelligence and Collaboration (JITSIC)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Joint International Taskforce on Shared Intelligence and Collaboration (JITSIC) is a group under the Forum on Tax Administration (FTA) that promotes information sharing amongst member jurisdictions. Through its unique Single Point of Contact (SPOC) network, it provides a platform for information exchanges and collaboration to address operational risks and drive tangible improvements in tax administration worldwide.</narrative>
  </description>
